        "verse": 7
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "EXO",
          "chapter": 14,
          "verse": 7
        }
      ],
      "en": "and he took six hundred chosen chariots, and all the chariots of Egypt, with captains over all of them.",
      "ko": "특별 병거 육백승과 애굽의 모든 병거를 발하니 장관들이 다 거느렸더라",
      "source_text_hash": "7c94ba83f1bec05d77850f707245d2663f0c5dc90dca439f6153f3aa342c56b1",
      "translation_text_hash": "cb38c2e7bf20ead41f81e085de6deee6ab70e826cc108be447ce0975e937a1e4",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "특별 병거 육백승과 애굽의 모든 병거를 발하니 장관들이 다 거느렸더라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "cb38c2e7bf20ead41f81e085de6deee6ab70e826cc108be447ce0975e937a1e4"
