      "en": "Moses stretched out his hand over the sea, and the LORD caused the sea to go back by a strong east wind all night, and made the sea dry land, and the waters were divided.",
      "ko": "모세가 바다 위로 손을 내어민대 여호와께서 큰 동풍으로 밤새도록 바닷물을 물러가게 하시니 물이 갈라져 바다가 마른 땅이 된지라",
      "source_text_hash": "33632d67694ba6652db23f0202eeb95f28966f0e147d5c9d7584895016b6116b",
      "translation_text_hash": "68d31bd461f367b22fea6789ca61667f60530fd07e7530deabf1c8cfd9617067",
