      "en": "In the morning watch, the LORD looked out on the Egyptian army through the pillar of fire and of cloud, and confused the Egyptian army.",
      "ko": "새벽에 여호와께서 불 구름기둥 가운데서 애굽 군대를 보시고 그 군대를 어지럽게 하시며",
      "source_text_hash": "6f74c13fee906222dee051a4f8f55da996f0ba1c3b434e971013c602d185ca11",
      "translation_text_hash": "85b56911760afd8ceacc79c9ceac0b0e83ef2be47673b70c286c8bb926130098",
